  {
   "id": "matematicas-2012-reserva-2-2",
   "n": 2,
   "num": 2,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Sea \\(f:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R\\) la función definida por \\(f(x)=x^3-4x\\).",
    "apartados": [
     "(0,75 p.) Halla la ecuación de la recta tangente a la gráfica de \\(f\\) en el punto de abscisa \\(x=1\\).",
     "(0,75 p.) Esboza el recinto limitado por la gráfica de \\(f\\) y la recta \\(y=-x-2\\), determinando los puntos de corte de ambas gráficas.",
     "(1 p.) Calcula el área del recinto anterior."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'>\\[f(1)=-3,\\qquad f'(x)=3x^2-4\\Rightarrow f'(1)=-1,\\qquad y+3=-(x-1)\\]<div class='res'>\\(y=-x-2\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>La recta \\(y=-x-2\\) es la tangente del apartado a). Cortes:</p>\\[x^3-4x=-x-2\\iff x^3-3x+2=0\\iff(x-1)^2(x+2)=0\\]<p>(\\(x=1\\) es raíz doble: el punto de tangencia.)</p><div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 220' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polygon points='57.1,110.0 59.5,101.3 61.8,93.3 64.1,86.0 66.4,79.2 68.8,73.1 71.1,67.5 73.4,62.6 75.7,58.2 78.0,54.3 80.4,50.9 82.7,48.1 85.0,45.7 87.3,43.9 89.6,42.4 92.0,41.4 94.3,40.9 96.6,40.7 98.9,40.9 101.2,41.5 103.6,42.5 105.9,43.8 108.2,45.4 110.5,47.3 112.9,49.5 115.2,52.0 117.5,54.7 119.8,57.7 122.1,60.9 124.5,64.2 126.8,67.8 129.1,71.6 131.4,75.4 133.8,79.5 136.1,83.6 138.4,87.9 140.7,92.2 143.0,96.6 145.4,101.0 147.7,105.5 150.0,110.0 152.3,114.5 154.6,119.0 157.0,123.4 159.3,127.8 161.6,132.1 163.9,136.4 166.2,140.5 168.6,144.6 170.9,148.4 173.2,152.2 175.5,155.8 177.9,159.1 180.2,162.3 182.5,165.3 184.8,168.0 187.1,170.5 189.5,172.7 191.8,174.6 194.1,176.2 196.4,177.5 196.4,177.5 194.1,176.4 191.8,175.2 189.5,174.1 187.1,173.0 184.8,171.9 182.5,170.8 180.2,169.6 177.9,168.5 175.5,167.4 173.2,166.2 170.9,165.1 168.6,164.0 166.2,162.9 163.9,161.8 161.6,160.6 159.3,159.5 157.0,158.4 154.6,157.2 152.3,156.1 150.0,155.0 147.7,153.9 145.4,152.8 143.0,151.6 140.7,150.5 138.4,149.4 136.1,148.2 133.8,147.1 131.4,146.0 129.1,144.9 126.8,143.8 124.5,142.6 122.1,141.5 119.8,140.4 117.5,139.2 115.2,138.1 112.9,137.0 110.5,135.9 108.2,134.8 105.9,133.6 103.6,132.5 101.2,131.4 98.9,130.2 96.6,129.1 94.3,128.0 92.0,126.9 89.6,125.8 87.3,124.6 85.0,123.5 82.7,122.4 80.4,121.2 78.0,120.1 75.7,119.0 73.4,117.9 71.1,116.8 68.8,115.6 66.4,114.5 64.1,113.4 61.8,112.2 59.5,111.1 57.1,110.0' fill='#b9a4f5' fill-opacity='.55'/><polyline points='33.9,236.6 36.8,216.5 39.7,197.7 42.6,180.1 45.5,163.8 48.4,148.6 51.3,134.7 54.2,121.8 57.1,110.0 60.0,99.3 62.9,89.6 65.8,80.8 68.8,73.1 71.7,66.2 74.6,60.3 77.5,55.2 80.4,50.9 83.3,47.5 86.2,44.7 89.1,42.7 92.0,41.4 94.9,40.8 97.8,40.8 100.7,41.4 103.6,42.5 106.5,44.2 109.4,46.3 112.3,48.9 115.2,52.0 118.1,55.4 121.0,59.2 123.9,63.4 126.8,67.8 129.7,72.5 132.6,77.4 135.5,82.6 138.4,87.9 141.3,93.3 144.2,98.8 147.1,104.4 150.0,110.0 152.9,115.6 155.8,121.2 158.7,126.7 161.6,132.1 164.5,137.4 167.4,142.6 170.3,147.5 173.2,152.2 176.1,156.6 179.0,160.8 181.9,164.6 184.8,168.0 187.7,171.1 190.6,173.7 193.5,175.8 196.4,177.5 199.3,178.6 202.2,179.2 205.1,179.2 208.0,178.6 210.9,177.3 213.8,175.3 216.7,172.5 219.6,169.1 222.5,164.8 225.4,159.7 228.3,153.8 231.2,146.9 234.2,139.2 237.1,130.4 240.0,120.7 242.9,110.0 245.8,98.2 248.7,85.3 251.6,71.4 254.5,56.2 257.4,39.9 260.3,22.3 263.2,3.5 266.1,-16.6' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><polyline points='20.0,92.0 131.4,146.0 242.9,200.0' fill='none' stroke='#f0a30a' stroke-width='2'/><circle cx='57.1' cy='110.0' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='15.1' y='102.0'>(−2,0)</text><circle cx='196.4' cy='177.5' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='202.4' y='187.5'>(1,−3)</text><g stroke='currentColor' fill='none' stroke-width='1.2'><path d='M12.0 110.0H294.0M150.0 214.0V8.0'/></g><line x1='57.1' y1='107.0' x2='57.1' y2='113.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='54.1' y='124.0' font-size='10'>-2</text><line x1='103.6' y1='107.0' x2='103.6' y2='113.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='100.6' y='124.0' font-size='10'>-1</text><line x1='196.4' y1='107.0' x2='196.4' y2='113.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='193.4' y='124.0' font-size='10'>1</text><line x1='242.9' y1='107.0' x2='242.9' y2='113.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='239.9' y='124.0' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='147.0' y1='177.5' x2='153.0' y2='177.5' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='134.0' y='181.5' font-size='10'>-3</text><line x1='147.0' y1='42.5' x2='153.0' y2='42.5' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='134.0' y='46.5' font-size='10'>3</text></svg></div><div class='res'>Se cortan en \\((-2,0)\\) y \\((1,-3)\\) (tangentes en este último)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado c",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Entre \\(-2\\) y \\(1\\), la cúbica queda por encima (en \\(x=0\\): \\(0\\gt-2\\)):</p>\\[A=\\int_{-2}^1(x^3-3x+2)\\,dx=\\Bigl[\\frac{x^4}4-\\frac{3x^2}2+2x\\Bigr]_{-2}^1=\\frac34-(-6)=\\frac{27}4\\]<div class='res'>Área \\(=\\dfrac{27}4\\ u^2\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
    {
     "tema": "funciones",
     "tipo": "tang",
     "apartados": "a"
    },
    {
     "tema": "integ",
     "tipo": "area",
