  {
   "id": "matematicas-2012-reserva-2-4",
   "n": 4,
   "num": 4,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Dadas las rectas \\(r\\equiv\\dfrac{x+3}{-6}=\\dfrac{y-9}4=\\dfrac{z-8}4\\) y \\(s\\equiv\\dfrac{x-3}3=\\dfrac{y-9}{-2}=\\dfrac{z-8}{-2}\\)",
    "apartados": [
     "(1 p.) Determina la posición relativa de las rectas \\(r\\) y \\(s\\).",
     "(1,5 p.) Calcula la distancia entre \\(r\\) y \\(s\\)."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>\\(r\\) pasa por \\(R(-3,9,8)\\) con director \\((-6,4,4)\\parallel(-3,2,2)\\); \\(s\\) pasa por \\(S(3,9,8)\\) con director \\((3,-2,-2)\\parallel(-3,2,2)\\). Los directores son proporcionales: paralelas o coincidentes.</p><p>¿Está \\(S\\) en \\(r\\)? \\(\\frac{3+3}{-6}=-1\\) y \\(\\frac{9-9}4=0\\): no. Por tanto, no son coincidentes.</p><div class='res'>\\(r\\) y \\(s\\) son paralelas</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Uso \\(\\vec d=(-3,2,2)\\) y \\(r\\equiv(-3-3t,\\,9+2t,\\,8+2t)\\).</p><p>La distancia entre dos rectas paralelas es la distancia de un punto de una de ellas a la otra<i class='n' data-t='why'>Entre dos rectas paralelas la distancia es la misma desde cualquier punto de una de ellas.</i>. Calculo \\(d(S,r)\\) proyectando \\(S(3,\\ 9,\\ 8)\\) sobre \\(r\\).</p><p><b>Paso 1. Plano perpendicular a </b>\\(r\\)<b> por </b>\\(S\\)<b>:</b> su vector normal es \\(\\vec d=(-3,\\ 2,\\ 2)\\). Es de la forma \\(-3x+2y+2z+D=0\\) y con \\(S\\): \\(D=-25\\). Queda \\(-3x+2y+2z-25=0\\).</p><p><b>Paso 2. Corte con </b>\\(r\\) \\((-3-3t,\\ 9+2t,\\ 8+2t)\\):</p>\\[-3(-3-3t)+2(9+2t)+2(8+2t)-25=0\\iff 17t+18=0\\iff t=-\\frac{18}{17}\\Rightarrow M\\left(\\frac{3}{17},\\ \\frac{117}{17},\\ \\frac{100}{17}\\right)\\]<p><b>Paso 3. Distancia:</b></p>\\[d(r,s)=|\\overrightarrow{SM}|=\\left|\\left(-\\frac{48}{17},\\ -\\frac{36}{17},\\ -\\frac{36}{17}\\right)\\right|=\\frac{12 \\sqrt{34}}{17}\\]<div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":-90,\"el\":42,\"p\":[[\"line\",[4.376,4.082,3.082],[-3.424,9.282,8.282],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[-3.424,9.282,8.282],\"r\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"line\",[6.6,6.6,5.6],[-1.2,11.8,10.8],\"#7c3aed\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[-1.2,11.8,10.8],\"s\",\"#7c3aed\",6,0],[\"line\",[3.0,9.0,8.0],[0.176,6.882,5.882],\"#16a34a\",2.0,true],[\"line\",[0.348,7.011,6.011],[0.166,7.132,6.132],\"#475569\",1.3,false],[\"line\",[0.166,7.132,6.132],[-0.005,7.004,6.004],\"#475569\",1.3,false],[\"pt\",[3.0,9.0,8.0],\"S\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[0.176,6.882,5.882],\"M\",-16,12]],\"ley\":[\"recta\",\"vector director\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 340 300' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='m12r2a4n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='m12r2a4d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='m12r2a4g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='m12r2a4r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><line x1='189.2' y1='246.0' x2='26.0' y2='92.4' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='32.0' y='92.4' fill='#2563eb' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>r</text><line x1='235.7' y1='171.6' x2='72.5' y2='18.0' stroke='#7c3aed' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='78.5' y='18.0' fill='#7c3aed' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>s</text><line x1='160.4' y1='100.7' x2='101.3' y2='163.3' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='2.0' stroke-dasharray='4 3'/><line x1='104.9' y1='159.5' x2='101.1' y2='155.9' stroke='#475569' stroke-width='1.3'/><line x1='101.1' y1='155.9' x2='97.5' y2='159.7' stroke='#475569' stroke-width='1.3'/><circle cx='160.4' cy='100.7' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='167.4' y='94.7' font-weight='700'>S</text><circle cx='101.3' cy='163.3' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='85.3' y='175.3' font-weight='700'>M</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='40.0' y2='270.0' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='42.6' y='274.0' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>x</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='24.0' y2='259.3' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='21.0' y='259.5' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>y</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='24.0' y2='258.1' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='21.0' y='257.9' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>z</text><g transform='translate(56.0,292)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>recta</text></g><g transform='translate(106.5,292)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='2.4'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>vector director</text></g><g transform='translate(210.0,292)'><circle cx='6' cy='-4' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>puntos</text></g></svg><p class='mut' style='font-size:.8rem;margin:.2rem 0;text-align:center'>Figura interactiva: arrástrala para girarla en 3D.</p></div><div class='res'>\\(d(r,s)=\\frac{12 \\sqrt{34}}{17}\\approx4{,}116\\) unidades</div><i class='n' data-t='tp'>Comprobación con la fórmula: \\(\\dfrac{|\\overrightarrow{RS}\\times\\vec d|}{|\\vec d|}=\\frac{12 \\sqrt{34}}{17}\\) ✓.</i></div>"
    }
