  {
   "id": "matematicas-2012-reserva-2-6",
   "n": 6,
   "num": 2,
   "bloque": "Opción B",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Sean \\(f,g:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R\\) las funciones definidas por \\(f(x)=x^2-2x\\) y \\(g(x)=-x^2+4x\\) respectivamente.",
    "apartados": [
     "(0,75 p.) Halla los puntos de corte de sus gráficas y realiza un esbozo del recinto que limitan.",
     "(1,75 p.) Calcula el área de dicho recinto."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'>\\[x^2-2x=-x^2+4x\\iff2x^2-6x=0\\iff x=0\\ \\text{ o }\\ x=3\\]<div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 210' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polygon points='60.0,148.2 63.7,140.0 67.5,132.1 71.2,124.5 75.0,117.3 78.8,110.3 82.5,103.7 86.3,97.4 90.0,91.3 93.8,85.6 97.5,80.3 101.2,75.2 105.0,70.4 108.7,66.0 112.5,61.9 116.2,58.1 120.0,54.6 123.8,51.4 127.5,48.5 131.2,45.9 135.0,43.7 138.8,41.8 142.5,40.1 146.2,38.8 150.0,37.8 153.8,37.2 157.5,36.8 161.3,36.7 165.0,37.0 168.8,37.6 172.5,38.5 176.2,39.7 180.0,41.2 183.8,43.0 187.5,45.2 191.2,47.6 195.0,50.4 198.8,53.5 202.5,56.9 206.2,60.6 210.0,64.6 210.0,64.6 206.2,72.8 202.5,80.7 198.8,88.3 195.0,95.5 191.2,102.5 187.5,109.1 183.8,115.4 180.0,121.4 176.2,127.1 172.5,132.5 168.8,137.6 165.0,142.3 161.3,146.8 157.5,150.9 153.8,154.7 150.0,158.2 146.2,161.4 142.5,164.3 138.8,166.9 135.0,169.1 131.2,171.0 127.5,172.7 123.8,174.0 120.0,175.0 116.2,175.6 112.5,176.0 108.7,176.0 105.0,175.8 101.2,175.2 97.5,174.3 93.8,173.1 90.0,171.6 86.3,169.8 82.5,167.6 78.8,165.2 75.0,162.4 71.2,159.3 67.5,155.9 63.7,152.2 60.0,148.2' fill='#b9a4f5' fill-opacity='.55'/><polyline points='45.0,184.1 48.8,174.7 52.5,165.5 56.2,156.7 60.0,148.2 63.7,140.0 67.5,132.1 71.2,124.5 75.0,117.3 78.8,110.3 82.5,103.7 86.2,97.4 90.0,91.3 93.8,85.6 97.5,80.3 101.2,75.2 105.0,70.4 108.7,66.0 112.5,61.9 116.2,58.1 120.0,54.6 123.8,51.4 127.5,48.5 131.2,45.9 135.0,43.7 138.8,41.8 142.5,40.1 146.2,38.8 150.0,37.8 153.8,37.2 157.5,36.8 161.3,36.7 165.0,37.0 168.8,37.6 172.5,38.5 176.2,39.7 180.0,41.2 183.8,43.0 187.5,45.2 191.2,47.6 195.0,50.4 198.8,53.5 202.5,56.9 206.3,60.6 210.0,64.6 213.8,68.9 217.5,73.6 221.2,78.5 225.0,83.8 228.7,89.4 232.5,95.3 236.2,101.5 240.0,108.1 243.8,114.9 247.5,122.1 251.2,129.5 255.0,137.3 258.8,145.4 262.5,153.8 266.2,162.6 270.0,171.6' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><polyline points='30.0,104.7 33.3,110.5 36.7,116.1 40.0,121.4 43.3,126.5 46.7,131.4 50.0,135.9 53.3,140.3 56.7,144.4 60.0,148.2 63.3,151.8 66.7,155.1 70.0,158.2 73.3,161.1 76.7,163.7 80.0,166.0 83.3,168.1 86.7,170.0 90.0,171.6 93.3,173.0 96.7,174.1 100.0,175.0 103.3,175.6 106.7,175.9 110.0,176.1 113.3,175.9 116.7,175.6 120.0,175.0 123.3,174.1 126.7,173.0 130.0,171.6 133.3,170.0 136.7,168.1 140.0,166.0 143.3,163.7 146.7,161.1 150.0,158.2 153.3,155.1 156.7,151.8 160.0,148.2 163.3,144.4 166.7,140.3 170.0,135.9 173.3,131.4 176.7,126.5 180.0,121.4 183.3,116.1 186.7,110.5 190.0,104.7 193.3,98.7 196.7,92.3 200.0,85.8 203.3,79.0 206.7,71.9 210.0,64.6 213.3,57.0 216.7,49.2 220.0,41.2 223.3,32.9 226.7,24.3 230.0,15.5' fill='none' stroke='#f0a30a' stroke-width='2'/><circle cx='60.0' cy='148.2' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='26.0' y='144.2'>(0,0)</text><circle cx='210.0' cy='64.6' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='216.0' y='60.6'>(3,3)</text><text x='140.0' y='28.4' fill='#2f6df0' font-size='12'>g</text><text x='222.5' y='31.1' fill='#f0a30a' font-size='12'>f</text><g stroke='currentColor' fill='none' stroke-width='1.2'><path d='M12.0 148.2H294.0M60.0 204.0V8.0'/></g><line x1='110.0' y1='145.2' x2='110.0' y2='151.2' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='107.0' y='162.2' font-size='10'>1</text><line x1='160.0' y1='145.2' x2='160.0' y2='151.2' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='157.0' y='162.2' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='210.0' y1='145.2' x2='210.0' y2='151.2' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='207.0' y='162.2' font-size='10'>3</text><line x1='260.0' y1='145.2' x2='260.0' y2='151.2' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='257.0' y='162.2' font-size='10'>4</text><line x1='57.0' y1='92.5' x2='63.0' y2='92.5' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='44.0' y='96.5' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='57.0' y1='36.7' x2='63.0' y2='36.7' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='44.0' y='40.7' font-size='10'>4</text></svg></div><div class='res'>Se cortan en \\((0,0)\\) y \\((3,3)\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Entre 0 y 3, \\(g\\) queda por encima:</p>\\[A=\\int_0^3\\bigl(-x^2+4x-x^2+2x\\bigr)dx=\\int_0^3(6x-2x^2)\\,dx=\\Bigl[3x^2-\\frac{2x^3}3\\Bigr]_0^3=27-18=9\\]<div class='res'>Área \\(=9\\ u^2\\)</div></div>"
    }
