   "bloque": "Opción B",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Los puntos \\(A(1,1,5)\\) y \\(B(1,1,2)\\) son vértices consecutivos de un rectángulo \\(ABCD\\). El vértice \\(C\\), consecutivo a \\(B\\), está en la recta \\(x=\\dfrac{y-6}{-2}=\\dfrac{z+1}2\\). Determina los vértices \\(C\\) y \\(D\\).",
    "apartados": []
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Resolución",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>La recta es \\(r\\equiv(t,\\,6-2t,\\,-1+2t)\\). Un punto de ella es \\(C(t,6-2t,-1+2t)\\). En el rectángulo el ángulo en \\(B\\) es recto: \\(\\overrightarrow{BA}\\perp\\overrightarrow{BC}\\).</p>\\[\\overrightarrow{BA}=(0,0,3),\\quad\\overrightarrow{BC}=(t-1,\\ 5-2t,\\ -3+2t),\\quad\\overrightarrow{BA}\\cdot\\overrightarrow{BC}=3(-3+2t)=0\\iff t=\\frac32\\]<p>\\(C\\left(\\frac32,3,2\\right)\\). El cuarto vértice: \\(D=A+\\overrightarrow{BC}=(1,1,5)+\\left(\\frac12,2,0\\right)\\).</p><div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":171,\"el\":14,\"p\":[[\"poly\",[[1,1,5],[1,1,2],[1.5,3,2],[1.5,3,5]],\"#f59e0b\",\"#b45309\"],[\"line\",[1.0,1.0,2.4],[1.097,1.388,2.4],\"#475569\",1.3,false],[\"line\",[1.097,1.388,2.4],[1.097,1.388,2.0],\"#475569\",1.3,false],[\"line\",[-0.4,6.8,-1.8],[2.2,1.6,3.4],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[2.2,1.6,3.4],\"r\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"pt\",[1,1,5],\"A\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[1,1,2],\"B\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[1.5,3,2],\"C\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[1.5,3,5],\"D\",7,-6]],\"ley\":[\"plano\",\"recta\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 340 300' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='m12rb4n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='m12rb4d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='m12rb4g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='m12rb4r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><polygon points='200.6,19.4 200.6,111.6 135.5,110.2 135.5,18.0' fill='#f59e0b' fill-opacity='.26' stroke='#b45309' stroke-width='1.2'/><line x1='200.